class_name Versions
extends RefCounted
## Every build's number, name and tweaks (his word, 9 Oct: "name versions of the game with latest
## tweaks and version number"). Newest first, and the newest is the number in the file VERSION.
## The title screen shows the newest. The IPA build (.github/workflows/build-ipa.yml) reads these
## lines with tools/versions.sh for the release's title and notes and the IPA's file name, and
## names the older releases from theirs. So keep one version a line, number|Name|tweak; tweak,
## with no quote or | inside, and add the new version's line at the top in its [ipa] commit.

const LIST := [
	"55|The Last Laugh|After every won run, THE FINAL FINAL BOSS laughs and steps out, in the form of the alignment you gathered most, with three forms each; GOOD: SIR BRAYSALOT, a dim but noble donkey knight with a carrot for a lance, who turns SUPER and then ULTRA HOLY, and sometimes trips over his own lance; LAWFUL: SENATOR SCALESWORTH, who is certainly not a lizard: filibusters, VETO stamps, a NEW TAX on your gold and red tape, then the mask slips; CHAOTIC: PROPHET NIGH, whose TRUE BELIEVERS flex at you until you are MOGGED, and when THE END comes, so do the meteors; EVIL: BARON VON CHONK, a fat cat who knocks things off a table at you, naps, gets THE ZOOMIES and has NINE LIVES and a laser dot; Beat it for THE LAST LAUGH and 400 embers, and if it beats you, the win still counts; A stability test: every hero, every rift world, classic and the loops played for 10 minutes each, and an hour of random buttons, with no error",
